Liferay-Releng-App-Description: A Content Marketing Platform (CMP) is a centralized software solution that streamlines the entire content marketing process, from planning and creation to multi-channel distribution. By offering full visibility across the content lifecycle, CMPs help ensure brand consistency, support data-driven decisions, and deliver relevant content to the right audience, ultimately driving engagement, lead nurturing, and revenue through high-quality storytelling.
